eak"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこでもいる普通の高校生。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも8/22からはまったく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までとは違った生活に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスのレッスン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ボイストレーニング"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演技のレッスン。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもこれも初挑戦で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に1番辛かったのはダンス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたくない日もありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが苦手なものを克服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しないといつまでも出来ないまま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"になってしまう。普通の高校生"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったらそのままでも良かった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、あたしは乃木坂46という"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルです。アイドルにとって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスは必須。だから克服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しなきゃだめだったから学校も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったけどほとんど休まずに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通ったし家でもいっぱい練習した。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その結果今でもやっぱり皆よりは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"覚えとかも遅いしへたっぴだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然苦じゃないしダンスが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に入ってたくさんのことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"経験させてもらって精神面も外見も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凄く磨かれたと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもう2年目に突入です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初々しいしいままの乃木坂46は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうこれで終わりで、これからは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと経験を積んでどんな会場や"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな取材でもいい意味の慣れが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あったほうが緊張せずに斉藤優里"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らしさは出せるんじゃないかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもっともっと坂を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"登って行くの。33人で。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここまで乃木坂46が活動出来たのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのおかげです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだあたし達に至らないこと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もあるかと思いますが暖かく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見守ってくれると嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもあたしはどんどん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成長していきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち止まることは出来ないんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は1人でだって走り続けて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたいのですがまだまだ未熟者。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの力を貸してください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい涙は流したくありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとずっと嬉しい涙だけ流したい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとは嬉しい涙を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に分かち合いたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうそんな関係ですよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日から1歩前進。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/19/7275138/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんにこにこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6880":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちぴょん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事へのコメントありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、浪漫みてくれたかた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうやったかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送されてなくてみれなかったかた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じよお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳥かごに自分がはいってるみたいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影すっごい楽しかったよ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またやりたいな(*・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊＊＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返し"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎好きな俳優は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└綾瀬はるかさんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎髪の毛どんなケアしてるの？やっぱりサロンとかでまめにトリートメントしてもらったり？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└ケアはしてない(笑)サロン行ってトリートメントしたこと無いー!毎日、アイロンはしてるかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎かずみんと仲良いみたいやけど、年けっこう違うのに話し合うの？あと、どんな話してるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└合うよ(*^^*)ハロプロさんなどのアイドルの話とか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ひなが一番好きなばしょは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└お家＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎好きなアニソンある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└王道やけど。残酷な天使のテーゼ、ハレ晴れユカイかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎カラオケでけいおんの曲うたう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└歌わない(>_<)ヽむずかしくって；でもね、よく聴いてる♪。Ｕ＆Iとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎福岡には、どこでも売ってるブラックモンブランは東京には売ってないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└ブラックモンブラン好き(*・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陽菜、全国にあるって思ってたけど、東京で見たことないっ＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎パフォーマンスするときに「ここを見てほしい」とか心がけてることは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└歌詞の意味を読みとって歌うことと笑顔かな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎朝起きたら最初にすることは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└アラームとめる(笑)その後、ニュースをみる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎プレゼント受け取った？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└うん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/4417438/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう！皆さんからの、プレゼント・お手紙はちゃんと大事にしてます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎PVの裏話は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└裏話ではないけど、走れ！bicycleの収録曲すべてのなかで自転車のったの陽菜だけなんだよ(*^^*)3年ぶりの自転車、怖かった(;O;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎読書感想文って得意？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└国語とか文章かくのすきやし、読書がだいすきだから割と得意o(^▽^)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎兄弟姉妹いる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└いる(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎運動出来る人と音楽出来る人どっちが好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└こだわり無いから難しいー；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも好き(*・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎乃木坂のイベント盛り沢山の夏だけど、陽菜がその中で印象に残ってる出来事は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└全部ー♪。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎学校ではどんなキャラ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└不思議ってめっちゃ言われる(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ラノベ読む？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└ちょっとだけなら(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎ライブでも呼び方は陽菜chanでいいのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└Ｗひなやから、かわごーとかのほうが分かりやすいかな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎もし生まれ変わるなら何になりたい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"└女の子＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr